      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2018-june/q1",
      "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf{M} = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 &amp; 1 &amp; -3 \\\\ 4 &amp; -2 &amp; 1 \\\\ 3 &amp; 5 &amp; -2 \\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^{-1}\"></span> giving each element in exact form.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Solve the simultaneous equations</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2x + y - 3z = -4\" data-display=\"true\"></div><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4x - 2y + z = 9\" data-display=\"true\"></div><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3x + 5y - 2z = 5\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(c) Interpret the answer to part (b) geometrically.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></p>",
