      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2018-june/q3",
      "question": "<p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Shade on an Argand diagram the set of points</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\{z \\in \\mathbb{C} : |z - 1 - i| \\leq 3\\} \\cap \\left\\{z \\in \\mathbb{C} : \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\leq \\arg(z - 2) \\leq \\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></p><p>The complex number <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w\"></span> satisfies</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"|w - 1 - i| = 3 \\text{ and } \\arg(w - 2) = \\frac{\\pi}{4}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Find, in simplest form, the exact value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|w|^2\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p>",
